Earthrift was used by [[Rassimov]] against [[Dante Vale]] and [[Lok Lambert]]. According to [[Dante Vale]] the target must watch one's feet to prevent severe injury from this spell. {{source|TCG:OAL-084|OAL-084}}

Earthrift is also a favored power of Wind who used it to defeat [[Wilder]] by targeting his shadow in [[Klaus' bookshop]] while hunting down the Amulet of [[Void]]. {{source|The Blood Spiral}}

Wind later used it in the [[Phoenix Volcano]] to stun Dante while fighting to claim the [[Amulet]] of [[Phoenix]], once again targeting his shadow this time created by a [[Boltflare]]. {{source|The Phoenix's Ashes}}

